{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>AIMosaic 是一款分享前檢查相片與截圖的私隱保護工具，適合經常傳送聊天截圖、送貨標籤、收據或合照的用戶。它會在本機提示可能敏感的位置，讓你自行決定遮蔽範圍；原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-243.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>本機辨識敏感內容</h2>\n<p>開啟截圖、收據或合照後，AIMosaic 會在本機提示臉部、電話、住址、證件與車牌等敏感位置；你可逐項開關建議、長按只遮所選字詞，或手動畫框與塗抹。內建七種遮蔽效果及文字水印，匯出可選 PNG 或 JPG 並保留原圖，全程在本機處理。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-255-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-256-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-257-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-258-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-259-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：AIMosaic: Photo Blur &amp; Redact</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/aimosaic-photo-blur-redact/id6833710138?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T19:40:13.173873+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":299,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T19:21:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T21:18:00.177359+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T19:33:39.950100+00:00","content_hash":"bf8ecb339740492ffef7abe2de7e5f34617485b187199458a977e83232b906eb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}